T11).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::store_tests` — `7 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 257 filtered out` (T12).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::writer_tests` — `7 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 257 filtered out` (T13).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::reader_tests` — `9 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 255 filtered out` (T14).\n- `cargo build --release` — `Finished release profile [optimized] target(s) in 1m 15s` (T15).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-daemon --lib rpc::event_capture_tests` — `6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 49 filtered out` (T15; includes `dispatch_error_records_tool_result_and_preserves_json_rpc_error` and `all_dispatched_workflow_tools_emit_call_and_result_events`).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::snapshot_tests` — `6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 258 filtered out` (T16).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::replay_tests` — `4 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 260 filtered out` (T17).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::corruption_tests` — `5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 259 filtered out` (T17).\n- `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::budget_tests -- --include-ignored` — `3 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 261 filtered out` (T17).\n\n### P99 budget artifacts (live re-run)\n\n- `daemon/target/event_budget/prepare_change.json`: payload 1514 B, 10 000 iterations, P50=338 µs, P95=474 µs, **P99=512 µs**, max=1097 µs.\n- `daemon/target/event_budget/get_context_capsule.json`: payload 383 B, 10 000 iterations, P50=150 µs, P95=212 µs, **P99=235 µs**, max=371 µs.\n- `daemon/target/event_budget/prepare_change_spill.json`: payload 586 B, 2 000 iterations, inline ceiling 256, P50=174 µs, P95=198 µs, **P99=212 µs**, max=237 µs.\n- 5 000 µs (5 ms) hot-path P99 budget met across all three cases with ≥10× headroom on `Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10610U CPU @ 1.80GHz`.\n\n## Issues encountered\n\nNone blocking. The review records 